  "stageId": "act5d0_10",
  "title": "1:11A.M.",
  "storyCode": "CB-10",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_10_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "05894a318a2076e7d578b3996406a030ee451a3602c9625d57adf5f6c86db81a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "鼠爺爺~！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "怎麼是你這小妮子，一個人跑來幹嘛啦？灰頭土臉的，又鑽通風管了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "嘿嘿，鼠爺爺，這是大門口的何叔給我的！何叔說我個子小跑得快，一刻鐘之內送到就請我吃優酪乳！你要給我作證！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "好，爺爺給你作證。你先去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "text": "謝謝爺爺！爺爺再見~！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看似普通的居民",
      "text": "老爺子。怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "還記得來找過我們的那幾個敘拉古人嗎？他們的“家族”已經完全從敘拉古轉移到了龍門。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看似普通的居民",
      "text": "需要聯繫線人嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "沒必要，按兵不動，他們會找上門來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看似普通的居民",
      "text": "為了什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "為了在這裡生存下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看似普通的居民",
      "text": "這可不需要經過任何人的同意，那他們怎麼不去和天災聊聊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "天災要是會說話，興許就用不著人們窩裡鬥了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "——正如您所言，鼠王先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "龍門有自己的規則，魏彥吾在十幾年前就默認了這個鐵律，我們絕不敢輕易違反。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "但您才是執行者，這也是我們今天冒昧來訪的原因。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "......你們想剷除企鵝物流，取而代之。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "正是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "你們對他們缺乏瞭解，西西里人。這筆生意你們得不到任何好處。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "text": "嘖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "（甘比諾！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "text": "你是在說我們贏不了嗎？“鼠王”先生？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "“輸贏”不是談生意的時候應該出現的詞，也難怪你逃離了敘拉古，你的確不是那個女人的對手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "甘比諾",
      "text": "你敢侮辱我的家族？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "你閉嘴，甘比諾！我們要的是針對企鵝物流的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "只要遵循規則，我沒有庇護企鵝物流的理由。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "——意思是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "企鵝物流是明面上的合法公司，能庇護他們的只有龍門的鋼鐵律法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "不過他們有時候的確觸犯了各方面的問題，而且從來不以為然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "但是切記，西西里人，切記不要越界。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "另類的秩序不代表沒有秩序，敘拉古應當最明白這個道理。可千萬別再麻煩我這把老骨頭動手了，答應我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "text": "——我明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "......龍門這個季節的星星，比想像中的多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "放在桌上的茶，也涼了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人",
      "text": "這是老爺的......喂，上工了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人",
      "text": "我不聾，趕緊打，打完正好去喝早茶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "text": "看來輪到我們了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "text": "反正之前也打過招呼了，把弩槍都放下，注意不要誤傷到無關人士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "text": "......該適應新的規則了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "我們是不是被包了個圓？裡三層外三層的那種？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "啊，戚風蛋糕卷？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "鼠王是貧民窟的話事人，他的爪牙自然無處不在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......為什麼不早說？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "我以為那只是個都市傳說，而且我也不知道他真的是隻老鼠。誰會這麼取外號？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "說什麼人流密集不好動手，這哪裡有什麼無辜民眾，明明全是敵人嘛！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "寸步難行呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "現在怎麼辦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "你一直在問怎麼辦，不如你自己想想？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "要來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "......你來了。這裡能清楚地看見下面的情況。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "你的朋友們正陷入苦戰，你不打算去幫個忙嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "我可沒聽說你會下這麼重的手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "我也不是所有事都會和年輕人推心置腹的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "也是，我總是會忘記，你是個什麼樣的人物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "很多人會忘記這一點，他們都死無葬身之地。你已經屬於特別優待了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "你殺了老闆，這件事不會這麼簡單地過去喔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "呵呵，我心裡明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "企鵝物流和他們的主人過於目中無人了，龍門在變化，不能總由著他們為所欲為。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "他們欠缺一個教訓，稍微嚴厲一些的教訓。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "過河拆橋的事情做多了，會遭到報應的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "你借企鵝物流的手做了那麼多事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "等等，你一開始就打算這麼做？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "誰知道呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "不可能的吧，你對自己應該扮演的角色拿捏得那麼好。嗯，起碼比我好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "呵呵......你真的很聰明。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "火焰在回應你的意志，你這是打算把我送進墓地裡嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "怎麼會呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "我可是非常尊老愛幼的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "莫斯提馬！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "等等，能天使，被包圍的是我們，不要打亂陣型。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "text": "嘁——！稍等！我馬上就過來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "這些傢伙混在普通市民之間，完全沒法好好戰鬥啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "這都是什麼和什麼啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "拜松，別發呆啊，你擋著我了！快閃開！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "每個人都是，各顧各的，就這樣該怎麼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "既然總是這樣，那就，各按各的來吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "聽得見嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "通訊？給誰的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "小心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "text": "專心點，空。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "好、好的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "你在的，對吧？一直都在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "少爺......我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "我不怪你，多半是父親多管閒事吧。但是現在，你得幫我一把。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "......明白了，少爺請吩咐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "眼前這仗勢，還用吩咐什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "把他們打飛就完事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "竟然會從少爺的嘴裡聽到這樣的命令。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "容我替老爺問一句，為什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......我哪管那麼多為什麼！可頌姐，讓一下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "噢噢——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "喝啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "text": "撞、撞飛了！？這下不是和我的定位重合了嘛！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "嗯......就結果而言，老爺應該會滿意的，但少爺繼續這樣......真的不會被企鵝物流帶偏嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "管家",
      "text": "不......不能繼續妨害少爺了，只要少爺覺得可以，那就可以，嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫",
      "text": "你這小子！乖乖躺下不好嗎！一起上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "text": "被躲開了！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫B",
      "text": "唔哦、痛！我的棍子被什麼東西打飛了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫A",
      "text": "小心，有狙擊手！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "給我讓開！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "......雖然是有在控制力度啦，但你一步都沒動過，是不是太不講理了點？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "站著不動，也不代表自己很輕鬆啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "在龍門真的有什麼可以打敗你嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "有啊，“龍門”可以。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "啊，狡猾的回答。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "我也是有堅持每天去公園晨練的，上了年紀，保持健康可是很重要的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "晨練會有這種效果？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "還要加上一點點人生閱歷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "那兩個敘拉古人如何了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "如何了呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "......真想知道，每天有多少這樣見不得光的事情被你悄悄解決了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "或者說，你讓那些企圖染指龍門的人自相殘殺了多少次？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鼠王",
      "text": "記不清了，孩子。我只記得為了活下去而前仆後繼的傢伙，遠比下水道裡的屍體要多，多得多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "莫斯提馬小姐！我來幫——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看似普通的居民",
      "text": "不許再靠近了。你們幾個，去幫老大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑幫&路人",
      "text": "是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "怎麼會讓你得逞！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看似普通的居民",
      "text": "狙擊？小少爺的保鏢嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "讓開！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看似普通的居民",
      "text": "你只是個普通的信使，你不該摻和進來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "信使？沒錯，我只是個信使。但是我們身後身前的那幾位最鬧騰的，好像都是信使。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看似普通的居民",
      "text": "德克薩斯他們和你不一樣，現在退出這場戰鬥，你還能保全自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "......你說了算？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "看似普通的居民",
      "text": "唔——！你還是有點本事的嘛！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "放手去做就對了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "——明白！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
